<p>Taste is intuitive, but it isn’t subjective. It is an opinion, but not a personal preference.</p>

<p>So what is taste? Simply put, taste is the ability to discern beauty. (Ask chatgpt to rewrite this part)</p>

<p>This is almost too banal of a definition if you take beauty to mean pretty, or visually pleasing.</p>

<p>Why is Taste so important</p>
<ul>
